OL,3,GNEWSACourt told Drumcree parade
OL,4,Adecision 'flawed' as residents mount
OL,5,Alegal challenge
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe decision to allow a controversial
OL,8,FOrange Order parade down a
OL,9,Fpredominantly nationalist road is being
OL,10,Fchallenged at Belfast's Court of Appeal
OL,11,Fthis morning
OL,13,FThere have been eight days of deadlock
OL,14,Fover the parade down Portadown's
OL,15,FGarvaghy Road since it was decided it
OL,16,Fcould proceed, a decision that reopened
OL,17,Fwhat was once Northern Ireland's most
OL,18,Fbitter parading disputes
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/4
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,412,410,260,120,0,100
PN,41102
SC,0002
CT,3,C
