OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSACourt told Drumcree parade
OL,4,Adecision 'flawed' as residents mount
OL,5,Alegal challenge
OL,6,
OL,7,FA lawyer for the residents told the
OL,8,FCourt of Appeal that the Parades
OL,9,FCommission, the organisation that
OL,10,Fapproved the march, "misdirected
OL,11,Fitself" when it came to assessing the
OL,12,Fpotential disorder the parade could
OL,13,Fcause
OL,15,FIn the mid-to-late 1990s, the dispute
OL,16,Fabout the parade from Drumcree Church
OL,17,Fdown the Garvaghy Road created yearly
OL,18,Fstand-offs, accompanied with riots,
OL,19,Froadblock and killings - read more
OL,20,Fabout the history of the dispute
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/4
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,412,410,260,120,0,100
